  "slug": "three-years-old",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/1993_three-years-old.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "A mother asked her son, “How old are you this year?”",
    "Her son answered, “I’m three years old.”",
    "She asked, “Then how old is Dad?”",
    "Her son said, “Dad is three, too.”",
    "Puzzled, she asked, “Why is Dad only three?”",
    "“Because he didn’t become a dad until the day I was born!”"
  ],
  "english_full": "A mother asked her son, “How old are you this year?”\n\nHer son answered, “I’m three years old.”\n\nShe asked, “Then how old is Dad?”\n\nHer son said, “Dad is three, too.”\n\nPuzzled, she asked, “Why is Dad only three?”\n\n“Because he didn’t become a dad until the day I was born!”",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Ма́ма спра́шивает своего́ сы́на: «Ско́лько тебе́ лет в э́том году́?»",
    "Его́ сы́н отве́ча́ет: «Мне́ три го́да.»",
    "Она́ спра́шивает: «Тогда́ ско́лько лет па́пе?»",
    "Его́ сы́н ска́зывает: «Па́па то́же три.»",
    "Озада́ченная, она́ спра́шивает: «Почему́ па́па лишь три?»",
    "«Потому́ что он не ста́л па́пой до те́х пор, пока́ я не роди́лся!»"
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Máma spráshivaet svoegó sýna: «Skól'ko tebé let v étom godú?»",
    "Egó sýn otvéchaet: «Mné tri góda.»",
    "Oná spráshivaet: «Togdá skól'ko let pápe?»",
    "Egó sýn skázyvaet: «Pápa tózhe tri.»",
    "Ozadáchennaya, oná spráshivaet: «Pochemú pápa lish' tri?»",
    "«Potomú chto on ne stál pápay do tékh por, poká ja ne rodílsya!»"
  ],
